      "comment": "ZIPPING GRESSIER (1) hit the ground running and was prominent to the turn but faded out of it when 5th at Maitland in Grade 4/5 company. Solid record here at the distance winning five races. Has winning claims on his best figures. KAELIX NITRO (4) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (22.68) in a NG at Gosford. Has a good record here including five wins. Expected to give a good account. HOOKED ON JOY (2) did a good job to finish third last time out over 400m at this track (23.18) in a Grade 4/5, the second top-three finish on the trot. Rates a winning chance on best. TIGER TAILS (8) can return to form after missing the top-three at this circuit last time out.",
